msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Gyeh... Haugh... Woargh... How can this possibly be...?\r\n"
"I thought I was destined to be the king of the ring..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "You won't be king of anything without getting enough practice in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Then, if I become a bouncer... will I be able to fight more opponents like "
"you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "I can't say for sure. But there's always that possibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"...All right then, I'll do it! Nothing like a real fight to\r\n"
"test a man's mettle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Are you sure about this, Iwakuma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Sorry, boss, but I need to do more than just stir veggies\r\n"
"in a pot and call it a day! I need to get strong enough to\r\n"
"shake up the entire sumo world!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"In fact, I'm bringing the title of yokozuna straight back\r\n"
"to Japan! Yeah, you heard me, I'm gonna be the champ!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Good, then let me set you up with this place. It's in a\r\n"
"building on Park Boulevard. You can go there whenever you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Okay, got it. This sounds like just the kind of training I need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Day in and day out, all I hear is, \"Salt! Miso! Soy sauce!\"\r\n"
"I didn't join a sumo stable to learn how to make nabe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"I joined so I could learn the art of sumo, dammit! So what's\r\n"
"the point of making some bullshit stew when I could be\r\n"
"wrestling my ass off instead!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"You're out of your mind, Iwakuma! There's no way you're\r\n"
"ready for the ring! You need more practice, more discipline,\r\n"
"and at least ten times more nabe! That's how you get strong!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Shut up! I'm good enough already! Besides, I don't need\r\n"
"any more practice⑬just get me into the ring and I'll show you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "(So this is Iwakuma... He seems to have quite the temper.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"(There's no way he'll talk to me in the middle of a tantrum.\r\n"
"Waiting for him to calm down would be the better option.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Hey, are you Iwakuma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "And what if I am!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Well, I was hoping we could talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"I'm Kiryu, and I'm working for a casino. We currently have\r\n"
"some openings for bouncers, so I thought I'd recruit you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"As a bouncer? What kind of crap is that? I'm gonna be the next\r\n"
"yokozuna, man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Without proper training, you'll be lucky if they let you sweep the stable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"Do tigers train!? Do bears train!? Psh... I'm so strong,\r\n"
"I could take on the world champion with one arm tied behind\r\n"
"my back! I mean, look at this massive body!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"And you... You saying I'm not good enough to be Japan's top\r\n"
"sumo wrestler!? Tell me why I should listen to some jackass\r\n"
"who's probably weak as shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"You want me to be a bouncer, then you're gonna have to\r\n"
"defeat me! Then I'll be whatever the hell you want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Now watch as I squeeze the life outta you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "(He doesn't look like he'll be calming down anytime soon...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "I'll talk some sense into him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "I'll wait for him to calm down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "I'll talk some sense into him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "I'll wait for him to calm down."
msgstr ""

